# Research priorities — 19.11.2026

The following priorities were communicated by **Kacper Wikieł** to the Benchmark Team and are preserved here as a reference for CodeSOTA contributors.

## Infrastructure and evaluation priorities

1. **Do not use personal GPU resources or paid accounts.** Contributors should not spend their own resources on benchmark evaluations. Contact the team when compute resources or API access are needed.
2. **Use [Fabryka AI Platform](https://fabryka.ai/platform)** for model API evaluations. Problems with the API should be reported to the team as the highest priority.
3. **Prioritize the benchmark list below** when planning evaluation work.
4. **Prioritize Bielik 11B v3.1 and Slayer 1B** for evaluation, with Bielik 11B v3.0 as an additional option.

